      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "I AM HELLBOUND (3) drew widest and worked when racing parked but boxed on okay in his last-start fourth at Menangle. He was G3 placed in Brisbane prior and also clocked in fourth in the Great Square. That is strong form for this and he draws to advantage. ALDEBARAN ABEL (8) came from this barrier when he won at this circuit and distance last month and has been runner-up in both outings here since. Can continue the strong form. CLAUDYS HERO (4) did a good job to come from a wide barrier and get within 4m off the winner when resuming. Proven second-up so can progress. MUSKEE (6) has been solid in both outings since winning from a similar draw at this venue. KARBINE (7) deserved the last-start win from a similar barrier following back-to-back placings. Can be competitive again with even luck.",
